00522 0475 39             RTS             RETURN TO CALLER (SUCCESS)
00523              *
00524              *
00525              *THIS ROUTINE CHECKS ON DISK READY FOR USE.  IF READ
00526              *RETURNS TO CALLER, IF NOT READY,  ABORTS OPERATION
