00549 0496 B7 0155        STA A  TRYCT    ATTEMPTED RETRIES ON READ ERR 
00550 0499 DE CA          LDX    SECP1    PICK UP THE DATA POINTER
00551 049B C6 80          LDA B  #128     DEFINE A SECTOR = 128 DECIMAL 
00552              *
