00576              *
00577              *THIS ROUTINE SEARCHES THE DEFINED DISK DIRECTORY FO
00578              *IF FOUND, X POINTS TO THE FCB OF THAT FILE IN THE B
00579              *
00580 04CC 0C      FNDFL  CLC             CLEAR THE C BIT FOR SHIFT
