00612 050D 26 14          BNE    FNDF4    AND
00613 050F A6 02          LDA A  $2,X     THE THIRD CHARACTER EQUALS
00614 0511 91 C2          CMP A  FLNM2    THE THIRD SEARCH CHARACTER
00615 0513 26 0E          BNE    FNDF4    AND
00616 0515 A6 03          LDA A  $3,X     THE FOURTH CHARACTER EQUALS
00617 0517 91 C3          CMP A  FLNM3    THE FOURTH SEARCH CHARACTER
00618 0519 26 08          BNE    FNDF4    AND
00619 051B A6 04          LDA A  $4,X     THE FIFTH CHARACTER EQUALS
00620 051D 91 C4          CMP A  FLNM4    THE FIFTH SEARCH CHARACTER
00621 051F 26 02          BNE    FNDF4    THEN
00622 0521 4F             CLR A           FILE NAME IS FOUND (SUCCESS E 
00623 0522 39      FNDFX  RTS             RETURN TO CALLER
