00655 0555 56             ROR B           SHIFT UID BITS 1,0
00656 0556 56             ROR B           INTO BITS 7,6
00657 0557 56             ROR B           7 BECOMES OLD 1, 6 BECOMES OL 
00658 0558 EA 07          ORA B  $7,X     OR IN SECTOR NUMBER FROM DESC 
00659 055A 5A             DEC B           MINUS ONE
00660 055B D7 07          STA B  ISCTR    STORE IN ISCTR
00661 055D 0C             CLC             CLEAR "C" FOR REVERSE SHIFT
