00702              *
00703              *
00704              *THIS ROUTINE ATTEMPTS TO CREATE A FILE ENTRY IN THE
00705              *VARIOUS RETURN FLAGS EXIST. THEY ARE ASSIGNED AS FO
00706              *A = 0 SUCCESS, FILE CREATED IN DIRECTORY
00707              *A = 1 FAILURE, NO ROOM LEFT IN DIRECTORY
00708              *A = 2 FAILURE, THIS FILE NAME ALREADY EXISTS
00709              *A = 3 FAILURE, NOT ENOUGH ROOM ON THE DISK
00710              *
00711 058F BD 04CC CREAF  JSR    FNDFL    SEARCH FOR FILE NAME (DUPLICA 
00712 0592 4D             TST A           IF DUPLICATE FILE NAME IS FOU 
