00752 05DD A7 00          STA A  $0,X     FILE CONTROL BLOCK INTO A DIR 
00753 05DF 96 C1          LDA A  FLNM1    ENTRY FOR THE REQUESTED FILE
00754 05E1 A7 01          STA A  $1,X     BY TRANSFERRING THE REQUESTED 
00755 05E3 96 C2          LDA A  FLNM2    FILE NAME INTO THE CURRENT FC 
